    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is fully developed by a single creator as a personal indie artwork. Therefore, any player's ideas and feedback will reach the developer directly and be genuinely cherished. The game will continue to evolve with the developer's learning and growth.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Outfits &amp; Dynamic Wear &amp; Tear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/88ba5b11913871038c42c2cdc6472636.poster.avif?t=1753985938\" width=548 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/88ba5b11913871038c42c2cdc6472636.webm?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/88ba5b11913871038c42c2cdc6472636.mp4?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect distinctive outfits through various means to fully express your character's charm. As you engage in combat, clothing will visibly sustain damage, enhancing immersion with a stronger sense of realism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics-Focused Combat with Minimalist Stats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/72eca9adef7ab176a279d58f5766906e.poster.avif?t=1753985938\" width=548 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/72eca9adef7ab176a279d58f5766906e.webm?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/72eca9adef7ab176a279d58f5766906e.mp4?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no permanent attributes. Character stats are dynamically generated based on equipped skills. This liberates players from complex stat screens, placing greater emphasis on mastering and exploring skill mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspect to Find Solutions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/48598491bbd499c023db148e5bfbe2ca.poster.avif?t=1753985938\" width=548 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/48598491bbd499c023db148e5bfbe2ca.webm?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/48598491bbd499c023db148e5bfbe2ca.mp4?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the inspect function to quickly examine objects, mechanisms, and characters within the environment. Gather vital intelligence to help devise effective strategies and uncover the background story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is fully developed by a single creator as a personal indie artwork. Therefore, any player's ideas and feedback will reach the developer directly and be genuinely cherished. The game will continue to evolve with the developer's learning and growth.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Outfits &amp; Dynamic Wear &amp; Tear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/88ba5b11913871038c42c2cdc6472636.poster.avif?t=1753985938\" width=548 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/88ba5b11913871038c42c2cdc6472636.webm?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/88ba5b11913871038c42c2cdc6472636.mp4?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect distinctive outfits through various means to fully express your character's charm. As you engage in combat, clothing will visibly sustain damage, enhancing immersion with a stronger sense of realism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics-Focused Combat with Minimalist Stats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/72eca9adef7ab176a279d58f5766906e.poster.avif?t=1753985938\" width=548 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/72eca9adef7ab176a279d58f5766906e.webm?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/72eca9adef7ab176a279d58f5766906e.mp4?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no permanent attributes. Character stats are dynamically generated based on equipped skills. This liberates players from complex stat screens, placing greater emphasis on mastering and exploring skill mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspect to Find Solutions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/48598491bbd499c023db148e5bfbe2ca.poster.avif?t=1753985938\" width=548 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/48598491bbd499c023db148e5bfbe2ca.webm?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755120/extras/48598491bbd499c023db148e5bfbe2ca.mp4?t=1753985938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the inspect function to quickly examine objects, mechanisms, and characters within the environment. Gather vital intelligence to help devise effective strategies and uncover the background story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
